  "description": {
   "en": "Xialys seems like typical a second-year college student. She's living with her freshman girlfriend who worked hard to get into the same school as her. But they both have some...problems. So maybe there's much more in store for their futures than just each other. Maybe, Xialys is destined to meet someone special, someone just as seemingly \"typical\" as she is."
